Date: Mon, 19 Oct 2026 12:10:18 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] logging: structure SQLite lifecycle and close diagnostics

Convert thirteen SQLite connection, backup and close diagnostics. Add custom typed database_version and error_code fields, without unrelated standard-schema roles. Copy SQLite-owned error text immediately into the record; format the message on the consumer. Preserve original levels and wording. Wallet notification callbacks are untouched.

